{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20907","headline":"南山田中行 · 李贺","name":"南山田中行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋野明，秋风白，塘水漻漻虫啧啧。\n云根苔藓山上石，冷红泣露娇啼色。\n荒畦九月稻叉牙，蛰萤低飞陇迳斜。\n石脉水流泉滴沙，鬼灯如漆点松花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}